  "body": "In [the tabindex attribute](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#the-tabindex-attribute) section where the case when the `tabindex` value is `null` is being described, there is a list of suggested elements that should be considered as focusable areas.\r\n\r\nThis list includes \"link elements that have an href attribute\" but since I don't believe `link` elements are ever focusable, I think this was maybe meant to refer to `area` elements that have an href attribute.\r\n\r\nI can open a PR to fix this, but please let me know if I should remove that list item completely or replace it with a reference to the `area` element instead.",
